GStreamer
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This gem is a binding, not an implementation. It contains no GStreamer code:
GObjectIntrospection::Loader reads GstPlay-1.0.typelib -- a machine-readable
description of the library, installed by gst-plugins-bad -- at require time and
defines Ruby classes from it. Nothing is linked, vendored, bundled or
redistributed here, and nothing in this repository is derived from GStreamer's
source.

GStreamer and its plugin modules are licensed LGPL-2.1-or-later. The gem reads
whatever copy the system already has.

